# Quizky environment variables
#
# The web app reads Cloudflare bindings from the platform (D1 as DB, and the
# private session-room worker as PRIVATE_SERVICE, which hosts the SessionRoom and
# PasswordHasher Durable Objects). These are configured in wrangler.jsonc files,
# not here.
#
# For local development, `pnpm run dev:all` starts the SvelteKit dev server and
# the session-room worker. The dev server talks to the room worker over HTTP.
#
# Optional overrides (leave unset unless you need them):
# SESSION_ROOM_DEV_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788
# PUBLIC_APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
